      "value": "@{5e89d0822aedbc56a3155d12|full_name}\n\nWe found a few unity events do work for doing this method.\n\nOnPreRender\n\nOnPreCull\n\nOnRenderObject - We chose this one since the other two don't work with how we time some cameras to capture at certain frame rates.",
