      "value": "@{60ee9e81572cc51ad4e847e6|full_name} You'd need to give a bit more info, because I don't think you're talking about the same thing.\n\nWhat I'm talking about specifically is a camera tracking the player's head position and rotation in a constant loop to overlay or track footage (eg;  Showing a player's vision in-game on a screen in a lobby, or over-rendering for a Portal effect)",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
    {
      "__v": 0,
      "_id": "66995286faa46252d5e2dc8e",
      "aiGenerated": false,
      "author": {
        "_id": "60ee9e81572cc51ad4e847e6",
        "alias": "Vervain Falcon",
        "aliasID": "65c291bded6eefce4cf7d1c9",
        "anonymized": false,
        "avatarURL": "https://canny-assets.io/images/f676d69583af8c2cddd6f37125d14763.png",
        "created": "2021-07-14T08:21:21.138Z",
        "name": "BobyStar",
        "serviceAccount": false,
        "urlName": null
      },
      "authorID": null,
      "boardID": "58c62f2b3cf8f8367753b2f0",
