      "value": "@{5e89d0822aedbc56a3155d12|full_name}\n\nThose 3 events fire everytime a camera is about to render, or is rendering, the scene.\n\nhttps://docs.unity3d.com/2022.3/Documentation/ScriptReference/MonoBehaviour.OnPreCull.html\n\nhttps://docs.unity3d.com/2022.3/Documentation/ScriptReference/MonoBehaviour.OnPreRender.html\n\nhttps://docs.unity3d.com/2022.3/Documentation/ScriptReference/MonoBehaviour.OnRenderObject.html",
